diff --git a/docs/ENGINEERED_INTELLIGENCE_STAGES.md b/docs/ENGINEERED_INTELLIGENCE_STAGES.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2f30211
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/ENGINEERED_INTELLIGENCE_STAGES.md
@@ -0,0 +1,84 @@
+# Engineered Intelligence Stage Genome
+
+RedlineDB exposes a conservative stage-genome surface for benchmarkable,
+drop-in candidate implementations.  The default genome names the existing
+engine behavior; it does not change runtime behavior by itself.
+
+## Safety classes
+
+* `ReplacementReady`: bounded policies that can be freely mixed after invariant
+  tests pass.
+* `CoordinatedReplacement`: performance-critical logic that shares semantics
+  with other stages and must declare a compatible semantic family.
+* `HookOnly`: named for observability/future epochs, but not replaceable until
+  a durable format or semantic epoch exists.
+
+## Replacement-ready method-level stage slots
+
+1. `heap.row_lane`
+2. `heap.relation_lane`
+3. `heap.reusable_page_choice`
+4. `heap.undo_read_policy`
+5. `buffer.victim_scoring`
+6. `buffer.prefetch_gate`
+7. `buffer.dirty_batch_size`
+8. `buffer.dirty_flush_order`
+9. `wal.write_batch_bytes`
+10. `wal.group_commit_delay`
+11. `wal.flush_resample`
+12. `wal.drain_batch_bytes`
+13. `planner.join_kind`
+14. `planner.aggregate_kind`
+15. `planner.ordering_kind`
+16. `exec.row_batch_policy`
+17. `exec.materialize_capacity`
+
+## Coordinated stage slots
+
+18. `mvcc.tuple_visibility`
+19. `txn.status_frontier`
+20. `mvcc.write_conflict_resolution`
+21. `locks.row_keying`
+22. `locks.wait_backoff`
+23. `heap.row_id_allocation`
+24. `heap.append_page_selection`
+25. `heap.undo_record_semantics`
+26. `commit.durability_barrier`
+27. `recovery.commit_filter`
+28. `recovery.heap_redo`
+29. `recovery.index_redo`
+30. `recovery.catalog_replay`
+31. `catalog.snapshot_codec`
+32. `catalog.schema_epoch_publish`
+33. `index.probe_strategy`
+34. `index.maintenance_delta`
+35. `checkpoint.batch_pacing`
+36. `vacuum.prune_and_reuse`
+37. `sql.access_path_selection`
+
+## Hook-only stage slots
+
+38. `format.page_codec`
+39. `wal.record_codec`
+
+## Open-fingerprint rule
+
+`OpenOptions::stage_genome` participates in the process-global open fingerprint.
+Opening the same path with different genomes in one process is incompatible,
+preventing benchmark contamination by accidental live-engine reuse.
+
+## Candidate admission
+
+Every candidate must emit a manifest containing:
+
+* `family`
+* `implementation`
+* `contract_version`
+* `params_hash`
+* `safety`
+
+Replacement-ready candidates must pass trait-level invariant tests, the SQLite
+parity corpus, and benchmark smoke tests.  Coordinated candidates must additionally
+declare compatible semantic groups for MVCC, heap, index, catalog, WAL, and
+recovery as applicable.
